    <reapack name="Aiwist_Transcriber.lua" type="script" desc="Ai Transcriber">
      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi Ai Transcriber: audio to MIDI in REAPER. Windows x64. Requires ReaImGui (cfillion) from ReaTeam Extensions. Includes the native Vulkan/CPU engine; models download separately in Settings. First launch displays bundled licenses.}</description>
        <link rel="website" href="https://github.com/Aiwist/ai-transcriber">GitHub</link>
        <link rel="website" href="https://boosty.to/aiwist">Boosty</link>
        <link rel="screenshot">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aiwist/ai-transcriber/main/assets/screenshots/screen-1.png</link>
        <link rel="screenshot">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aiwist/ai-transcriber/main/assets/screenshots/screen-2.png</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.0.2" author="Aiwist" time="2026-11-13T13:58:18Z">
        <changelog>Audio to MIDI in REAPER: local transcription on CPU or Vulkan GPU.
Install through ReaPack or with the standalone ZIP installer; both deliver the same files.
Models Small, Medium and Large are installed in Settings; licenses are shown on first launch.</changelog>
